WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:05.410
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and yesterday
in my Suicide Squad video I asked you to submit

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:06.410
all your questions.

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:09.990
I picked 10 of them to answer in this video
with one bonus question.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.940
So much to talk about Harley Quinn, the finale,
season 3.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:18.221
The throughline in the episode and something
I think will play into the finale is that

00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:20.400
line, “A Bad Man Turned Good.”

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.199
Just remember that idea when you think about
the big villains this season.

00:00:24.199 --> 00:00:27.550
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do Arrow and Flash videos every week with

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.550
bonus Q&amp;As.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.630
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
leave me suggestions for future videos you

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:32.890
want me to do.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.120
So let’s answer some questions.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.870
Careful for spoilers if you’re not caught
up on the show.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:43.429
Question 1 - Z Music 2013 asks Do you think
Shrapnel blowing up is like a grundy thing?

00:00:43.429 --> 00:00:47.170
Where they end up returning looking more like
they do in the comics?

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:50.219
Mark Guggenheim explained that they chose
to kill Shrapnel just because they wanted

00:00:50.219 --> 00:00:53.989
to convey the idea that the Suicide Squad
members are expendable.

00:00:53.989 --> 00:00:57.179
That doesn’t mean he couldn’t come back
in a future episode.

00:00:57.179 --> 00:00:59.089
But we’re supposed to think he’s dead.

00:00:59.089 --> 00:01:03.339
Don’t plan on seeing him again the rest
of this season, but until you see someone’s

00:01:03.339 --> 00:01:04.900
cold body on a table.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.780
They’re not confirmed dead.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:11.280
And if they ever introduce weirder powers
on the show like Magic or the lazarus pit,

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.560
death will become meaningless.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.530
Which is part of the reason they haven’t
done that yet.

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:18.830
But I’m really hoping to see someone literally
come back from the dead soon.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:20.560
Agent Coulson style.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:25.880
Question 2 - BD Destro asks Do you think Deathstroke
and Merlyn are working together?

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:29.560
No, I think Merlin’s involvement is purely
tied to Thea and Moira.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.149
If there’s any Slade crossover it will be
coincidental.

00:01:32.149 --> 00:01:36.221
Merlin is such a big character though, I would
be really disappointed if he doesn’t fight

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:38.000
Slade at some point.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.380
Merlin wants to protect Thea, Slade wants
to destroy Oliver’s family.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:45.689
It only stands to reason that at some point,
Merlin will end up fighting Slade with Oliver

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:48.119
or helping Oliver in some way.

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:49.380
Remember the theme of the Suicide Squad episode.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.670
A Bad man turned good.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:55.609
I think that’s foreshadowing for both Merlin
and Slade this season.

00:01:55.609 --> 00:02:00.289
Question 3 - DigiDestined 5555 asks Do you
think that Slade could be Roy's father, and

00:02:00.289 --> 00:02:01.770
that's why he survived the serum?﻿

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:06.320
I think that’s an awesome theory, here’s
what is said about Roy’s Father in the comic

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.320
books.

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:11.460
His history has been retconned a few times,
but for a while he was a wealthy businessman

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:14.890
who died in a plane crash on on an island,
leaving Roy stranded.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:20.010
Kind of like Oliver’s father died in the
boat crash leaving him stranded.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:24.730
Another time Roy’s father was a scientist
who died when one of his experiments exploded.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:29.130
Like Doctor Ivo (even though Ivo isn’t confirmed
dead yet).

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:32.100
So you can tie Roy to characters that already
exist on the show.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.170
But I think those are just coincidences.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:37.760
I think that Roy survived just because he’s
special like Slade and Oliver.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:41.750
I think Oliver would totally have survived
the mirakuru if Ivo had dosed him with it.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:46.560
But it is fun to think about Arrow as having
this Empire Strikes Back storyline.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:51.480
Deathstroke is Darth Vader with the mask and
he tries to turn Roy to the darkside by revealing

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.060
he can give him what he wants more than Oliver
can.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:57.310
I just like the idea of that Deathstroke Empire
Strikes Back.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.360
That would make a great spinoff show.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:03.830
Question 4 - Lunatic Reason (no avatar) asks
They mentioned Markovia again.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.141
Anyone want to see the Outsiders like I do?

00:03:05.141 --> 00:03:09.670
They should do a season with Green Arrow travelling
the world on the hunt or Slade.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:14.380
Rex Mason in Egypt, Katana in Japan, Geo Force
in Markovia and so on.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.380
﻿

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.820
Nice idea, as Arrow progresses into Season
3 and beyond I definitely think we’ll see

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.240
the show tell more international stories.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.330
The Universe is always expanding.

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:25.130
Just ask Neil Degrasse Tyson and Carl Sagan.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:29.430
Most of the time they don’t do stories like
that just because they have to focus on building

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:34.780
Starling City stories, which this season is
the Deathstroke A-story.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:38.780
Smaller plots like the suicide squad have
to bow in service of that at a certain point.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:43.290
So they can’t just jump from superhero to
superhero all over the place.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:47.570
But next season you’ll definitely see even
more suicide squad, more travel and more new

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:49.120
secondary characters.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:54.140
A lot of those new characters will probably
be shared with The Flash, also in service

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:59.760
of creating this unified universe just like
Marvel is doing with their movies and tv shows.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.870
Question 5 - Thomas McCain asks in the last
scene with Sara and Oliver in the episode,

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:08.020
when Oliver takes Sara's hand, did anyone
else get the expectation that one of them

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:09.150
were going to propose?

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:12.670
Nice theory, in case anyone hasn’t read
the comics.

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:18.360
There was a certain point several years ago
where Green Arrow and Black Canary got married.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:22.100
The show has been shipping them hard this
season and I’ve seen a lot of evidence to

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:26.509
suggest Caity Lotz will be back next season,
but there hasn’t been any confirmation.

00:04:26.509 --> 00:04:28.289
So Deathstroke could still kill her.

00:04:28.289 --> 00:04:31.180
I’m hoping he just kills Moira, not that
I hate her.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.660
It’s just that I love Caity Lotz so much.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.020
And someone has to die.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:41.199
If the Canary survives through the finale,
them doing the marriage storyline would be

00:04:41.199 --> 00:04:45.830
an awesome cliffhanger for Season 3 and give
Oliver’s character an interesting place

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.509
to go emotionally.

00:04:47.509 --> 00:04:50.801
Remember how he said to Felicity that he has
to keep everyone at arm’s length just to

00:04:50.801 --> 00:04:51.990
protect them.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.699
What would happen if he ever got married to
someone.

00:04:54.699 --> 00:04:58.110
Sara said she’s not the girl on the island
anymore, so it’s possible that they want

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:02.180
us to think that she’s strong enough as
a character to withstand being in a long term

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:03.490
intimate relationship with Oliver.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.580
Being married to a superhero isn’t all fun
and games.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.979
There’s a lot of punching and kicking.

00:05:07.979 --> 00:05:13.729
Question 6 - Roque Yanez asks Who would be
your picks for a Teen Titan’s spinoff?

00:05:13.729 --> 00:05:18.080
Off the top of my head i’d say you have
to do Cyborg, Ravager, Jericho and Roy.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.960
I don’t know how they’d do beast boy,
starfire or raven at this point, just because

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.960
we haven’t seen those types of powers on
the show yet.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:28.069
And Superboy is a whole messy copyright issue.

00:05:28.069 --> 00:05:32.749
I think in season 3 what we’ll see is a
mini-teen titans esque story.

00:05:32.749 --> 00:05:36.280
Like Roy and Sin and a couple other characters
will get a side story that Oliver isn’t

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:37.419
a part of.

00:05:37.419 --> 00:05:40.820
That will be the closest thing to a live action
Teen Titans.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:44.189
If it goes well they’ll totally develop
it for pilot someday.

00:05:44.189 --> 00:05:48.349
Question 7 - Jim Moriarty asks How do you
think the Suicide Squad will be a part of

00:05:48.349 --> 00:05:50.080
the final fight with Deathstroke?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:54.770
Yes, that’s what that whole finale scene
with Amanda Waller was.

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:59.669
They’re going to use them whenever Oliver
finally goes after Slade.

00:05:59.669 --> 00:06:04.719
Episode 18 is called Deathstroke, so it could
either come then or in one of the final episodes.

00:06:04.719 --> 00:06:07.479
Shrapnel is dead for all intents and purposes.

00:06:07.479 --> 00:06:11.199
So either it will just be Bronze Tiger, Deadshot,
Diggle and Lyla.

00:06:11.199 --> 00:06:14.219
Or they’ll add another villain, like Merlyn
or Huntress.

00:06:14.219 --> 00:06:19.249
I’m not expecting any other new comic characters
outside of Ra’s Al Ghul, and the two Flash

00:06:19.249 --> 00:06:21.310
people Killer Frost and Vibe.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:24.600
I don’t any of them will join the Squad.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:30.030
The interesting thing is that I don’t think
this final fight, will be the final fight.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:35.939
I think Ra’s Al Ghul will come and Slade
will end up having to work with Oliver temporarily.

00:06:35.939 --> 00:06:39.210
I don’t think he’ll stop being a bad guy,
but it will be like Deadshot.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:43.520
They’re still self-serving villains, but
they just team up with heroes breifly.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:48.159
And in this case Slade and Oliver will have
to work together to deal with Ra’s Al Ghul

00:06:48.159 --> 00:06:49.469
after he comes.

00:06:49.469 --> 00:06:53.979
At least if Manu Bennett’s comments on the
arrival of Ra’s Al Ghul are to be believed.

00:06:53.979 --> 00:06:56.720
We’ll have to see how it actually goes down.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:57.979
But remember that big theme.

00:06:57.979 --> 00:06:59.879
A Bad Man Turned Good.

00:06:59.879 --> 00:07:03.509
Question 8 - Jose Beltran asks do you think
Barry Allen will be present for the fight

00:07:03.509 --> 00:07:04.509
with Slade?

00:07:04.509 --> 00:07:09.180
No, Marc Guggenheim actually confirmed that
in this timeline of events, Barry is still

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:10.180
in the coma.

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.039
He’ll wake up in the Pilot episode of The
Flash.

00:07:12.039 --> 00:07:17.610
So that’s why those other Flash characters
are cameoing in episode 20.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:19.909
No idea what they’ll be doing in Starling
City though.

00:07:19.909 --> 00:07:24.569
Question 9 - HG Drifter asks Do you think
we'll get the actual Oracle or will Felicity

00:07:24.569 --> 00:07:27.440
fill her role in the Birds of Prey episode?﻿

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:32.009
Felicity will fill the role of Oracle, because
her character is wheelchair bound we’re

00:07:32.009 --> 00:07:33.020
all kind of worried for her safety.

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:37.909
I think Arrow will just change things a little,
so she can become that Oracle character without

00:07:37.909 --> 00:07:40.059
getting her spine broken.

00:07:40.059 --> 00:07:43.969
Just like the suicide squad, they’re going
to be slowly developing the Birds of Prey

00:07:43.969 --> 00:07:45.949
as a thing on Arrow though.

00:07:45.949 --> 00:07:50.150
So there will be more Huntress, Canary, Felicity
team ups in season 3.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.759
Think of next week’s episode as like the
beginning of that.

00:07:52.759 --> 00:07:56.400
They won’t be best friends at the beginning
though.

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.729
Their trio relationship will evolve over time.

00:07:58.729 --> 00:08:03.971
Question 10 - 101 Movie Games (no avatar)
asks Episode 19 is called Under the Hood do

00:08:03.971 --> 00:08:06.870
you think this could mean Red Hood or just
play on words?

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:11.770
It means a couple things, but it has nothing
to do with The Red Hood.

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:16.089
First it’s a reference to someone else finding
out Oliver’s true identity.

00:08:16.089 --> 00:08:17.460
Probably Detective Lance or Laurel.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:18.460
Only one person is going to learn who he is.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:23.009
The second meaning is Roy, his Arsenal/Red
Arrow persona will be developing more.

00:08:23.009 --> 00:08:29.010
The episode after that is called Seeing Red,
so I think that will mostly continue the Roy-Red

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:30.010
Arrow plot.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.630
He’s supposed to get his official costume
this season.

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:35.560
So that might be when that happens.

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:40.230
Bonus question - LA Prodigy asks Do you think
that the Arrow/Flash Universe will ever be

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:43.060
a part of the Batman/Superman Movie universe?

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:46.630
I think they’re definitely trying to make
that happen as much as possible.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:51.730
Warner Brothers did have Christopher Nolan
overseeing their DC Comics Properties like

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.760
Joss Whedon is doing for Marvel.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:57.680
If you’re not familiar, Joss Whedon isn’t
just directing the Avengers movies, he’s

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.810
like the creative director for the Marvel
Universe.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:05.940
That means he steps in to all of their movies
and shows and talks with the writers and directors

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:09.250
to make sure everything blends with everything
else they’re trying to do.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:14.820
I don’t think Christopher Nolan is doing
that for DC and Warner Brothers anymore, but

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.400
if he’s not, then someone else is.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:20.600
I know Geoff Johns is highly involved with
the creative aspects of all their tv shows

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:21.870
in development.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.620
So short answer yes, they are all connected.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:28.590
Asterisk though, not as connected as Marvel’s
Universe.

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:30.600
So thank you so much guys for submitting you’re
questions.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.570
These types of videos are always fun to do.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.870
Next week is birds of prey.

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:36.140
Be sure to subscribe to get my video.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:38.261
I’ve got a bunch of other videos to do,
but I’ll try to do another bonus Flash video

00:09:38.261 --> 00:09:39.261
soon.

00:09:39.261 --> 00:09:42.850
Right now click here for my suicide squad
review and click here to learn more about

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:43.850
the flash.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:44.850
Thanks for watching.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:45.850
See you guys tonight.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:46.260
High Fives!

